title: slider plugin with tree view

Ref to https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zEQWc-alBMQ

The tree view is tidgraph,
 https://ihm4u.github.io/tw5plugs/ 
and the slider is a bit of custom wikitext:


```
Depth: {{$:/Range 4}}


 <$range tiddler="$:/Range 4" min="1" max="5" default="1" increment="1"/>
<$set name="depth" value={{$:/Range 4}}>
<$tidgraph start="tiddlername" maxdepth=<<depth>> />
</$set>
```

So Range 4 is the name of a background tiddler/ card, you could put any name there, the ``{{}}`` transcludes the value of that tiddler into the text.

```
 <$range tiddler="$:/Range 4" min="1" max="5" default="1" increment="1"/> creates the slider.

<$set name="depth" value={{$:/Range 4}}> sets the depth value in the tid graph to the value of Range 4

<$tidgraph start="name at top tree" maxdepth=<<depth>> /> is the call to tidgraph to the tiddler it starts building the tree from.
```

All created by one of the lovely people in the tiddlywiki gouggle group.